      { "id": "question-tag-tavern-a2-01", "q": "You're tired, ___?", "options": ["aren't you","isn't it","don't you"], "answer": 0, "why": "“You're” = you are, so the tag uses are: aren't you." },
      { "id": "question-tag-tavern-a2-02", "q": "She likes coffee, ___?", "options": ["doesn't she","isn't she","doesn't it"], "answer": 0, "why": "Present simple with she: the tag uses does, made negative: doesn't she." },
